    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位路人！\n也許<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能幫忙解決我的煩惱？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D8DEF4EBAFF01000A4E5F8A3100100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD5E6B5FD989E36C7A62117684716960F1FF1F001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳所見，我是個藝術家。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "598200100003110000FF01014F6059B36240898BFF0C6211662F500B85DD88535BB63002001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在畫要拿去參加比賽的\n風景畫，但……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B635728756B898162FF53BB53C352A06BD48CFD7684000A98A8666F756BFF0C4F4620262026001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請看！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB770BFF01001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "藤蔓的痕跡就占在噴水池前，\n有夠礙事的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "85E48513768475D58DE15C315360572856746C346C60524DFF0C000A6709592079194E8B7684FF01001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可是靠我的寶可夢的招式\n又沒辦法破壞它……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF662F9760621176845BF653EF5922768462DB5F0F000A53C86C928FA66CD5783458DE5B8320262026001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！從天而降的靈感！\n無法破壞它，那麼燒了它不就好了？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF015F9E5929800C964D76849748611FFF01000A71216CD5783458DE5B83FF0C90A39EBC71D24E865B834E0D5C31597D4E86FF1F001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n為了解決我的煩惱，\n請用寶可夢的招式，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n把礙事的藤蔓痕跡燒掉吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF0100100001BE01000A70BA4E8689E36C7A62117684716960F1FF0C000A8ACB75285BF653EF5922768462DB5F0FFF0C00100001BE00000A628A79194E8B768485E4851375D58DE171D2638954273002001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
